WEBVTT

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.730
This is my first time learning
how heavy the truth can be.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.240
The mournful memories that
have transcended time...

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:15.620
The pain from the past silently
dissolves within our hearts.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:21.500
So the eternal blazes that were kindled
in our hearts that day don't go out...

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.080
So we don't fade into the deep darkness...

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.000
So we can protect the bonds we share...

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.260
The door to the future will finally open.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:40.010
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.100
The master of the Book of Darkness has...

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.060
completely separated herself
from the defense program!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:47.730
Understood.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:52.860
Everyone, that black mass beneath
you is where it'll start going berserk!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.820
Until Chrono-kun arrives,
don't approach it recklessly!

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.860
Um... okay!

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.000
Activate administrator powers.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:20.090
I've slightly interrupted the
defense program's progression.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.930
It will only last a few minutes, but it should
give you some time before it goes berserk.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:24.680
Alright.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.890
That should be plenty of time.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:34.110
Return the Linker Cores,
and rebuild the Guardian Knight System.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:02.010
Come to me, my knights.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.900
Vita-chan!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.150
Signum!

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.910
We are the guardian knights who gather
before our master, she of the Night Sky.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:31.200
As long as our master exists,
our souls will never extinguish.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:35.960
As long as we have life in our bodies,
we will stand by each other.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:42.550
We will always exist before our master,
Queen of the Night Sky, Yagami Hayate.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:46.840
Reinforce, bestow upon
me my staff and armor.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:47.550
Yes.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.280
Hayate-chan!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:10.030
Light of the Night Sky,
come to my hand!

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:13.040
Blessed wind, Reinforce...

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.250
Set up!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.440
Hayate...

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.030
I'm terribly sorry...

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:49.370
Umm... Hayate-chan, we...

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:55.290
It's fine, I know what happened.
Reinforce told me.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.210
We can worry about
the minor details later.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:02.800
For now... welcome back, everyone.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.350
Hayate! Hayate!

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.600
Hayate!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:27.530
Nanoha-chan, Fate-chan, I'm really sorry.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.870
My children have caused
you so much trouble.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.910
Not at all.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:33.870
It's fine.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:39.120
Sorry... I hate to ruin the mood, but...

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:42.380
I'm Enforcer Chrono Harlaown from the
Time-Space Administrative Bureau.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.880
We don't have much time,
so I'll keep this brief.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.090
About that dark mass over there...

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:51.180
The Book's defense program will
start going berserk in a few minutes.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.720
We have to stop it by any means necessary.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:58.020
Right now, there are two plans to stop it.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:02.520
The first is by using extremely
powerful freezing magic.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.570
The second is to utilize our ship on standby in orbit.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:09.530
The Arthra's magic cannon,
the Arc-en-ciel, can obliterate it.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:12.870
Do you have any other ideas?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:16.540
I wanted to check with the Book's
master and her guardian knights first.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:21.670
Umm... I think the first plan
will be quite difficult...

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:26.550
Without a master, the defense program
is like a mass of condensed magic.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:31.300
Even if you do freeze it, its reincarnation
cycle won't end as long as the core is intact.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.050
The Arc-en-ciel is no good, either!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:38.180
If you fire it here, Hayate's
house will also get blown away!

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:41.270
I-It's that powerful?

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:45.940
It's a magic cannon that distorts
space-time surrounding the target point,

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.820
annihilating everything
within a 100-kilometer radius.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.570
Does that make sense?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.070
Umm... I'm also against using that, then!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.990
Me, too! I'm definitely against it!

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.990
The captain and I don't
want to use it, either...

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:02.580
But if that thing really goes berserk,

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:05.080
it'll create far more victims
than we ever could.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.710
Once it goes out of control,

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:10.170
it devours everything it touches
and infinitely increases in size.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.840
Alright, everyone!

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.590
There are now less than fifteen minutes
until that thing reaches critical mass!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.350
You better decide something quickly!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.890
So, do you have any ideas?

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:25.150
I'm sorry... I don't think we
can be all that useful here...

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:29.320
We also have very little experience
with it going out of control.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:32.190
But if we don't stop it...

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:35.360
I don't really want Hayate-chan's
house to get obliterated, either...

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:38.580
We're way beyond such
small-scale damage...

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.250
If we could move the
battle further offshore...

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.040
Even if we're over the ocean,
its distortions will still cause victims.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.380
Everyone's so annoying with these unimportant complaints!

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.840
Can't we just blow it up together
and finish it off already?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.340
A-Arf...

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.930
It's not that simple...

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.390
Blow it up... together...

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:07.060
We can't fire the cannon here because
there'll be too many victims...

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:09.320
But if it's not here...

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.190
Chrono-kun!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.240
Can the Arc-en-ciel be fired anywhere?

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.950
Anywhere?
Like where?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:21.790
Where the Arthra is right now!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.040
In orbit... in outer space!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:32.550
You'd better not underestimate the
technology of the Administrative Bureau!

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:34.300
Of course we can fire it up here!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.180
In outer space, or anywhere else for that matter!

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.640
Hey, just wait a sec, you guys...

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:39.850
D-Don't tell me...

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:41.850
Yep.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.310
Has the light died down...?

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:53.570
Yeah, but there's still some
black thing above the sea...

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.780
Just what is that thing?

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:59.490
It won't just keep getting
bigger and bigger, right...?

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:03.450
I get the feeling that everything
is going to be okay...

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.370
Because they're fighting
against it for us...

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.750
You mean Nanoha and Fate?

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:11.500
Yeah...

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.670
When you say that with such
a serious look on your face...

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.510
I get the same sort of feeling,
so I'm scared...

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.640
But at any rate...

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.060
I still don't get any of this!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:31.190
What the heck's happening
on this Christmas Eve?!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:31.730
Hey...

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.150
If I'm dreaming, let me wake up already!

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:33.900
Hurry up and end! Geez!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.400
Arisa-chan... calm down.
Hurry up and end! Geez!

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:41.740
What to say here...? As always,
they're quite amazing in many ways...

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:46.040
Looking at the numbers, it's kind of scary
thinking that they might be able to do it...

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.370
Chrono-kun, we're on standby here!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:50.750
Only ten minutes left until
it reaches critical mass!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:55.750
It's a very risky plan that relies
on each of our powers...

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.670
but, it's worth trying!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.630
The defense program's
barrier consists of

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:03.510
four layers of physical
and magical protection.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:05.560
First, we have to destroy that.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.850
Once we break through the barrier,

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.810
we'll attack the main body all
at once and expose the core.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:13.770
Then, Yuuno-kun's group will
combine their teleportation magic

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.190
and teleport it in front of the Arthra!

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:20.200
And then we just have to
hit it with the Arc-en-ciel...

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.160
If everything goes according to plan,
this will be the best possible method.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.660
Admiral, can you see the current situation?

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.080
Yes, quite clearly.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.210
The Book of Darkness was a cursed tome.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:38.800
That curse devoured many, many lives
and threw many others into chaos.

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.300
Thanks to it, both my mother and I...

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:48.810
and many other victims and their families
were forced to live such tragic lives.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:52.810
And I'm sure it's the same
for you and the Liese twins.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:56.650
But the past we've lost cannot be changed.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:57.520
Start up.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:04.320
Which is why I will fight now,
and change the future!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.080
Begin charging the Arc-en-ciel!

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:07.830
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.070
Two minutes until it goes berserk!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.900
Nanoha-chan, Fate-chan...

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.280
Shamal...

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:48.280
Yes. You want me to heal them, right?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:52.000
Klarwind, time to do what we do best!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:52.830
Yes.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:56.790
Dear zephyr, carry the
blessing of healing.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:19.190
I am Shamal, Knight of the Lake,
and this is the Ring of Breezes, Klarwind.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:21.320
Healing and support is our specialty.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.440
This is amazing!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.820
Thank you very much, Shamal-san!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.820
We'll be on support.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.540
We'll be sure to stop that
annoying barricade.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:31.910
Yeah.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:32.830
That's right.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.290
It's beginning.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.300
The Tome of the Night Sky...

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.300
and the program that made it known as the "cursed Book of Darkness"...

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.930
The Darkness of the Book of Darkness.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.280
Chain Bind!

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.820
Struggle Bind!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:16.250
Chain it, Steel Yoke!

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:26.550
You better match my timing,
Takamachi Nanoha!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.340
You too, Vita-chan!

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:33.850
I'm Vita, the Iron Hammer Knight,
and the Iron Count, Graf Eisen!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.600
Gigantform.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:50.200
Roaring Smash!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:53.780
Gigant Crusher!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:04.210
Takamachi Nanoha and
Raising Heart Excelion, on our way!

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.970
Load Cartridge.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.480
Excelion Buster!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.060
Barrel Shot.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.610
Break...

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.000
Shoot!

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.970
Next up are Signum and Testarossa-san!

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:03.020
The Sword Knight, Signum, is the soul,
and the fiery demonic sword is Laevatein!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:09.280
By combining sheath with sword,
a new form joins the fight.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.330
Bogenform.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.840
Fly, Falcon!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.430
Sturmfalken.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:47.940
Fate Testarossa and
Bardiche Zanber going now!

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.620
Strike through it, Thunder Blade!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:06.830
Jet Zanber.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.720
I am the Guardian Beast of the Shield, Zafira!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.310
I won't let you fire anything!

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.020
Hayate-chan!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.070
Rise from beyond, branches of mistletoe.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:39.030
Become spears of the silver
moon and break through!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:47.080
Petrifying spears, Mistilteinn!

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.570
What <i>is</i> that thing?

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:20.990
This is... rather incredible...

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.080
As I thought, average attacks
like these won't work!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.910
It'll just regenerate
whatever gets damaged!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:29.330
But the attacks <i>are</i> getting through to it!

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.000
We're not giving up on this plan!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.340
Let's do this, Durandal.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.420
Okay, boss.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:41.090
Permafrost, construct a frozen coffin
and deliver eternal sleep unto this beast.

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:53.520
Freeze!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.280
Eternal Coffin.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.120
Let's do it,
Fate-chan, Hayate-chan!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.290
Yeah!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.380
Starlight Breaker.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.010
Full power, full throttle!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:24.010
Starlight...!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:27.850
Lightning Flash!
Plasma Zanber!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:37.070
I'm sorry...

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.740
Good night...

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.080
Sound the Horn of Judgment,

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.200
Ragnarök!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:56.250
Breaker!

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.390
Main core, show yourself!

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.900
I've... got it!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.400
Long-distance teleport!

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:21.900
Destination: outer space!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.660
Teleport!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.960
The core is being teleported here!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:41.970
It's beginning to rapidly
heal its body in transit!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.970
Arc-en-ciel, barrel expansion!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.730
Firing lock system, open.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:03.820
Confirm the firing lock,
and reposition the ship to a safe distance!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:04.570
Begin!

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.070
Roger!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.840
Arc-en-ciel, fire!

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:14.560
All mass in the firing zone
has been completely vaporized.

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.060
Reincarnation signals... non-existent!

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:18.020
Good.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:24.530
Maintain a general watch over the area
and continue to scan the firing zone.

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:25.650
Roger.

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:34.200
Alright... everyone down
there, good work!

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:36.790
The situation has been taken care of!

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:46.300
Now we only have to clear the wreckage and
repair the city... and a lot of other stuff, but...

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:49.840
For now, you should all return to the
Arthra and take a well-deserved rest.

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:55.220
Umm... what happened to
Arisa-chan and Suzuka-chan?

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:55.970
Ah...

00:22:57.520 --> 00:23:00.980
I released the barrier around the parts of
the city that weren't badly damaged...

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:01.940
so that's where I returned them.

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.480
Geez! What's going on here?!
so that's where I returned them.

00:23:04.480 --> 00:23:05.980
Darn it!

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:08.700
I see... thank goodness.

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:12.320
Chrono... good job.

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:13.370
Yeah...

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:17.250
You did a great job, too.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:18.580
Thank you, Fate.

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:20.620
Hayate!

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:21.750
Hayate-san!

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:31.470
Hayate!

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:33.890
Hayate... -chan...?

00:25:08.940 --> 00:25:12.610
And the Book of Darkness case finally
comes to a close, once and for all.

00:25:12.610 --> 00:25:18.370
Everyone has nothing but smiles and
gratitude for those they've met.

00:25:18.370 --> 00:25:21.700
And with the end comes
farewells and a departure,

00:25:21.700 --> 00:25:24.580
and the time to start
walking down a new path.

00:25:24.580 --> 00:25:26.790
Next time on
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A's:

00:25:27.420 --> 00:25:28.790
The final episode:

00:25:28.790 --> 00:25:30.250
Stand by, Ready.

00:25:30.800 --> 00:25:33.920
I'm sure this isn't an ending...
but rather, a new beginning.
